OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog without prickles made
OL,4,Acharity ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hedgehog that lost its prickles due
OL,7,Fto an infection has become an
OL,8,Fambassador for a wildlife rescue
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FOlly developed ringworm in the wild
OL,12,Fwhich caused all of his spines to fall
OL,13,Fout.
OL,15,FJudy Thompson, co-founder of Prickles
OL,16,Fin a Pickle in Stoke Fleming, Devon,
OL,17,Fwhere Olly has been for the last four
OL,18,Fmonths, said: "Somebody said he looks
OL,19,Flike a rolled up sock, and he looks a
OL,20,Fbit like a very large potato. He's
OL,21,Fabout 1kg (2.2lb) in weight."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
